<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK'S NEW MARKKA&amp;TALOUS DUE JUNE 16 1330.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK'S NEW MARKKA&amp;TALOUS DUE JUNE 16 1330.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland will release on June 16 at 1330/1030 GMT the 2/1997 issue of its quarterly policy publication Markka &amp; Talous, the central bank said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bank of Finland governor Sirkka Hamalainen will present the economic outlook in the leading article at a news conference at 1330, the bank said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
